0d56190ca" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186459683} :answer-field/id #uuid "def1656c-545d-5cfa-a67e-9b8e056e29f2" :answer-field/key "R" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186460708} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "2722381f-88ef-56ef-a90e-bfc76e1d1ba4" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186459685} {:answer/id #uuid "07815c18-f8cd-571f-9d19-35dea685dd79" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186459686}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "2722381f-88ef-56ef-a90e-bfc76e1d1ba4" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186459685} :answer-field/id #uuid "8af4482e-9012-5e8b-8245-fe732b4fca3e" :answer-field/key "Z" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186460709}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485 :db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "d88d3c9d-ec93-5bf2-a49b-0b326607c0ea" :question/math-academy-id "q-181441" :question/problem "Consider the following sets:\n\n$$\nN,\\,Z,\\,Q,\\,R,\\,C\n$$\n\nTo which of these sets does the number $\\sqrt{-1}$ belong?\n\nSelect all that apply." :question/worked-solution "![](images/67/67ef97be4b21a74feaae15f3ff30d5077fc1316874df8de79155316a621e4487.png)\n\nRecall the following:\n\n- $N$ represents the set of **natural numbers**.\n\n- $Z$ represents the set of **integers**.\n\n- $Q$ represents the set of **rational numbers**.\n\n- $R$ represents the set of **real numbers**.\n\n- $C$ represents the set of **complex numbers**\n\nWith that in mind, we note the following:\n\n- First, we note that $\\sqrt{-1}=\\text{i}$ is a complex number. Therefore, we can write\n\n$$\n\\sqrt{-1}\\in C.\n$$\n\n- Since the imaginary part of $\\sqrt{-1}$ is nonzero, it does not belong to $N,Z,Q,$ or $R.$ We can write\n\n$$\n\\sqrt{-1}\\notin N,\\,\\sqrt{-1}\\notin Z,\\,\\sqrt{-1}\\notin Q,\\,\\sqrt{-1}\\notin R.\n$$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"$C$ only.\""}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186055242 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186054629 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "b0e5efaa-e624-5045-abdb-cdf8d32ad6cb" :knowledge-point/title "Identifying Subsets of a Given Set"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "567ee540-f868-58f6-8a22-b389f40b3088" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186459889} {:answer/id #uuid "3efd5279-91f1-52b4-a04b-51927a8cf6e2" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186459890}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "567ee540-f868-58f6-8a22-b389f40b3088" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186459889} :answer-field/id #uuid "b1eb285e-fe49-5845-aff7-765608420828" :answer-field/key "I" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186460811} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "0f21f876-dc36-5b82-ad2f-c3edc167fd2a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186459891} {:answer/id #uuid "2c08a37d-1f6c-5d13-8b43-e5759e4f9a2d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186459892}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "2c08a37d-1f6c-5d13-8b43-e5759e4f9a2d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186459892} :answer-field/id #uuid "d404df38-0fca-56f7-bb2a-3ae751fe5a67" :answer-field/key "II" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186460812} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "2d9e21d8-4ce8-5051-87c0-59cbcaa4b780" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186459893} {:answer/id #uuid "90dba915-8387-53ae-a5e9-ad052992e0b8" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186459894}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "2d9e21d8-4ce8-5051-87c0-59cbcaa4b780" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186459893} :answer-field/id #uuid "0f014c32-c82b-5d46-995e-3b33708a4ea4" :answer-field/key "III" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186460813}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045486 :db/ident :question.difficulty/hard} :question/id #uuid "8e8eb5c8-f406-5cdf-99fb-6d6cbbcd6c06" :question/math-academy-id "q-37255" :question/problem "Which of the following sets is a subset of $A={{1},{2,3},{1,3,6}}?$\n- **I.** ${2,{1}}$\n- **II.** ${{2,3}}$\n- **III.** ${{-1},{1,3,6}}$\n\nSelect all that apply." :question/worked-solution "A set is a subset of $A$ if all its elements are elements of $A.$ \n\nWith that in mind, let's inspect each option.\n\n- ${2,{1}}$ is *not* a subset of $A$ because it contains the element $2\\notin A.\\,\\times $\n\n- ${{2,3}}$ is a subset of $A.\\,✓$\n\n- ${{-1},{1,3,6}}$ is *not* a subset of $A$ because it contains the element ${-1}\\notin A.\\,\\times $\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"II only\"."}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186055244 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186054815 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "abc6b3ee-0251-5c9c-9358-bd192c434dd1" :knowledge-point/title "Identifying Ele