t{6}$ is positive, not negative, so it does *not* belong to ${Q}^{-}.\\,\\times $\n\n- $0$ is not negative, so it does *not* belong to ${Q}^{-}.\\,\\times $\n\nIn conclusion, the correct answer is \"None of those listed\"."}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186055390 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186054799 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "ef650886-8d46-583e-bad0-1429ba496479" :knowledge-point/title "Identifying Variables"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "b61f390c-dc49-56e3-939e-c8d717165440" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186460101} {:answer/id #uuid "4eb87ea7-84e8-5f96-af00-32ec07de6f0a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186460102}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "4eb87ea7-84e8-5f96-af00-32ec07de6f0a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186460102} :answer-field/id #uuid "12444429-ec85-5dba-a2e4-b617437cd867" :answer-field/key "I" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186460917} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "8a213790-014a-5909-ba47-49c13b1ac600" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186460103} {:answer/id #uuid "98ea4de7-9a1f-5c96-8233-7ef6aa7b9837" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186460104}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "8a213790-014a-5909-ba47-49c13b1ac600" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186460103} :answer-field/id #uuid "5947dc32-69be-5c6c-ad48-7a7b55ba7e31" :answer-field/key "II" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 1759218640816