 downward, like a \"frown\" ($⌢$), then the graph is said to be *concave down*.\n\nIt's helpful to remember the mnemonic \"concave down like a frown.\"\n\nOnly graph III curves upward (like a \"smile\") among the given graphs."}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186064512 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186064316 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "8edb0a6c-f22f-56cf-9545-2fae93896db2" :knowledge-point/title "Verifying Continuity at a Point Using the Definition"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "2a8662b0-fb2f-5171-b01f-382934bc5cc8" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186459553} {:answer/id #uuid "61f973b1-b0c6-5b87-b6b1-9ba65dc89e05" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186459554}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "61f973b1-b0c6-5b87-b6b1-9ba65dc89e05" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186459554} :answer-field/id #uuid "6f9e9c56-fe3f-5f92-abe3-36a570dc0f56" :answer-field/key "I" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186460643} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "930eb0b7-9c85-56f1-9e64-eacc6678902f" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186459555} {:answer/id #uuid "6f616fbf-4237-5137-ba0c-efb9f6a5bb3e" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186459556}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "6f616fbf-4237-5137-ba0c-efb9f6a5bb3e" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186459556} :answer-field/id #uuid "076dd6c9-01bd-509f-a759-2c228cec2286" :answer-field/key "II" :answer-field/t